{
  "$comment": "Copy to models.json and edit (optional: without it these defaults are used). Keys come from Settings → API keys or .env (apiKeyEnv). provider: anthropic | openai (any OpenAI-compatible endpoint) | mock. You rarely need to list cloud models here: for every provider you add a key for (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, OpenRouter, NVIDIA NIM, NanoGPT, Groq, xAI, DeepSeek, Mistral) the full, current model list is fetched automatically, and Ollama / LM Studio models are detected. Profiles here take precedence for the same model, so use them to tune settings (vision, toolSet, effort…).",
  "default": "claude-opus",
  "profiles": [
    {
      "id": "ark-deepseek-v4.1-flash",
      "label": "DeepSeek V4.1 Flash (Volcano Ark coding plan)",
